### Changes in this version (8.0.0-pre.11) since 8.0.0-pre.10

#### New features:
 - [%as:]: unavailable nodes are now hidden by default
 - [%as:]: stopped creating double licenses for cloud only sign-ups
 - [%as:]: added hubspot email functionality to stripe endpoint
 - [%as:]: added customer deleted endpoint
 - [%as:]: also listen for subscription cancel events
 - [%as:]: enabled update_subscription endpoint
 - [%as:]: added update_subscription endpoint
 - [%as:]: added missing background-tasks
 - [%as:]: added further endpoints for stripe
 - [%as:]: added initial version of stripe endpoint
 - [%as:]: added initial versions of stripe endpoints
 - [%as:]: added better error reporting when lacking policy permissions
 - [%as:]: added support for multiple license policies and restricting access based on policy
 - [%as:]: updated programs to use bundled binaries as defaults

#### Bugfixes:
 - [%as:]: fixed job queue program not filtering correctly
 - [%as:]: fixed push instead of append
 - [%as:]: fixed using wrong ID in update endpoint
 - [%as:]: fix for when a user adds an additional license
 - [%as:]: fixed typo
 - [%as:]: slurm allocation should be updated even if the user account already exists
 - [%as:]: checkout webhook now checks for 6 licenses instead of just 2
 - [%as:]: added missing comma
 - [%as:]: fixed missing variables
 - [%as:]: fixed endpoint
 - [%as:]: fixed call to non-existant pre()
 - [%as:]: fixed destination.pre() not being called from resumable configs
 - [%as:]: fixed missing program stats
 - [%as:]: fixed showing hidden queue usage in API (fixed digichem-desktop#103)
 - [%as:]: fixed bundling both digichem and digilib into same dir

#### Miscellaneous:
 - [%as:]: bumped version to pre.11
 - [%as:]: moved each stripe endpoint to seperate file
 - [%as:]: further rearranged webhook code
 - [%as:]: moved some digichem specific IDs into auth
 - [%as:]: moved webhook endpoints to separate directory